WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.970
- My next guest is no joke one
of the hottest musical stars

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:06.230
on the actual planet right now.

00:00:06.230 --> 00:00:09.520
She is one quarter of the
K-pop supergroup, BLACKPINK,

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:11.850
and her first solo track "On the Ground"

00:00:11.850 --> 00:00:15.610
has topped the iTunes charts
in more than 50 countries.

00:00:15.610 --> 00:00:19.600
And she has over 37 million
Instagram followers.

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:21.040
So, okay.

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:23.381
Give it up for Rosé, everybody!

00:00:23.381 --> 00:00:24.214
(Kelly claps)

00:00:24.214 --> 00:00:27.272
(sting music)

00:00:27.272 --> 00:00:28.240
- Hi, Kelly!
- Oh my gosh!

00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:31.460
Okay, I have to start with this, Rosé.

00:00:31.460 --> 00:00:34.270
I've never been cooler to
my niece than this moment

00:00:34.270 --> 00:00:35.103
right now.

00:00:35.103 --> 00:00:36.560
She is such a huge fan of yours.

00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:39.970
She actually legit
introduced me to your music.

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:41.477
I was like, "Oh my God, I love this!"

00:00:41.477 --> 00:00:42.310
"I would chill with this."

00:00:42.310 --> 00:00:45.280
And we were listening
to y'all at my house.

00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:48.070
So anyway, I know that
you're a Korean pop star

00:00:48.070 --> 00:00:51.310
but you didn't grow up
necessarily in Korea, right?

00:00:51.310 --> 00:00:52.143
- Yeah.

00:00:52.143 --> 00:00:55.730
I was born in New Zealand
and I grew up in Australia.

00:00:55.730 --> 00:00:57.590
- That's such an interesting background.

00:00:57.590 --> 00:00:59.190
I love- I love New Zealand and Australia,

00:00:59.190 --> 00:01:00.400
by the way, as well.

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:03.150
But your family says that you
like to sing on road trips.

00:01:03.150 --> 00:01:04.720
Is that true?

00:01:04.720 --> 00:01:06.140
- That's very true.

00:01:06.140 --> 00:01:07.530
Since we lived in Australia,

00:01:07.530 --> 00:01:09.280
we took a lot of like,

00:01:09.280 --> 00:01:10.500
long,

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:11.640
hour road trips.

00:01:11.640 --> 00:01:13.740
Like we would take like
seven, eight hour road trips,

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:17.270
and I sang like a lot
of Taylor Swift, like,

00:01:17.270 --> 00:01:18.740
Beyonce like songs, but I-

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:22.470
I really wanted to mention
that "Because of You"

00:01:22.470 --> 00:01:24.840
was definitely a part of that playlist,

00:01:24.840 --> 00:01:26.280
and I think it was on repeat.

00:01:26.280 --> 00:01:28.507
I can sing it from top to bottom.

00:01:28.507 --> 00:01:30.440
- Okay, I cannot wait
to tell my niece that,

00:01:30.440 --> 00:01:33.270
'cause I'm so not cool to
her, but now I will be.

00:01:33.270 --> 00:01:34.370
Thank you for that.

00:01:34.370 --> 00:01:36.110
Thank you for the cred.

00:01:36.110 --> 00:01:38.310
Well, congrats on your new song, man.

00:01:38.310 --> 00:01:41.310
I love "On the Ground."
It is such a cool song.

00:01:41.310 --> 00:01:44.550
How would you describe
your new music to everyone?

00:01:44.550 --> 00:01:49.520
- I would say the song really
resonates with me, myself.

00:01:49.520 --> 00:01:50.997
There's a part in the song that says,

00:01:50.997 --> 00:01:53.700
"I've worked my whole
life just to get high,"

00:01:53.700 --> 00:01:56.120
just to be like, "look at
me, I'm never coming down."

00:01:56.120 --> 00:01:57.747
But it eventually says,

00:01:57.747 --> 00:01:59.630
"But everything I need is on the ground."

00:01:59.630 --> 00:02:02.120
And it's just a song that kind of

00:02:02.120 --> 00:02:04.090
tries to keep everybody grounded.

00:02:04.090 --> 00:02:05.660
- Yeah!
- Tries to tell everybody,

00:02:05.660 --> 00:02:06.860
take a moment to sit back

00:02:06.860 --> 00:02:09.480
and think about what really
matters, you know, to us.

00:02:09.480 --> 00:02:12.140
- Absolutely! It's also
one hell of a vibe.

00:02:12.140 --> 00:02:13.890
It's a really cool song.

00:02:13.890 --> 00:02:14.723
I'm into it.

00:02:14.723 --> 00:02:16.740
So, well when my staff found out

00:02:16.740 --> 00:02:19.580
that you were going to
be here, they freaked.

00:02:19.580 --> 00:02:23.100
Do you mind if one of my
producers asks you a question,

00:02:23.100 --> 00:02:25.126
'cause she really wants to.

00:02:25.126 --> 00:02:26.600
- Not at all! I'd love that!

00:02:26.600 --> 00:02:27.670
- Okay, awesome!

00:02:27.670 --> 00:02:30.920
Please, everybody welcome
senior associate producer,

00:02:30.920 --> 00:02:33.306
Jasmine Stephen, everybody!

00:02:33.306 --> 00:02:34.990
(Kelly imitates horn)

00:02:34.990 --> 00:02:37.131
Give it up for Jasmine!

00:02:37.131 --> 00:02:38.439
- Hi, Jasmine!

00:02:38.439 --> 00:02:39.450
(Kelly laughs)

00:02:39.450 --> 00:02:41.870
- So, Jasmine, you're a massive K-pop fan.

00:02:41.870 --> 00:02:44.620
I did not know that, this is awesome.

00:02:44.620 --> 00:02:47.300
- Absolutely! Like, I
have been known to, like,

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:51.030
call out of work just to fly
across the country to go see X.

00:02:51.030 --> 00:02:53.160
I didn't do that here! I promise you!

00:02:53.160 --> 00:02:55.350
But like, I've done it before.

00:02:55.350 --> 00:02:57.616
- Well now we know where
you're going to be, Jasmine.

00:02:57.616 --> 00:02:58.600
(Kelly laughs)

00:02:58.600 --> 00:03:00.350
So what would you want to ask Rosé?

00:03:01.640 --> 00:03:04.050
- So Rosé, as you know,
I'm a huge fan of yours,

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:05.870
but I love your puppy, Hank!

00:03:05.870 --> 00:03:07.430
He is so cute!

00:03:07.430 --> 00:03:10.260
So I just want to know,
what's his favorite food?

00:03:10.260 --> 00:03:11.620
What's his favorite color?

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:13.230
And can I be his best friend?

00:03:13.230 --> 00:03:15.090
And then additionally, if
I can be his best friend,

00:03:15.090 --> 00:03:16.800
can I be his godparent?

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:19.080
(Kelly laughs)

00:03:19.080 --> 00:03:20.280
- She is getting in there!

00:03:20.280 --> 00:03:21.970
She wants it all, Rosé!

00:03:21.970 --> 00:03:23.050
(Kelly laughs)

00:03:23.050 --> 00:03:25.273
- Any time! I would love that!

00:03:26.220 --> 00:03:28.630
I mean, Hank is like, the cutest puppy.

00:03:28.630 --> 00:03:31.140
I adopted him. I actually-

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:33.730
So, in Korea, there's like
a bunch of people who upload

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:35.380
these, um, puppies

00:03:35.380 --> 00:03:38.390
who are up for like, adoption,

00:03:38.390 --> 00:03:40.870
and they kind of don't have a home.

00:03:40.870 --> 00:03:42.590
And so I saw him online,

00:03:42.590 --> 00:03:46.030
and this lovely lady was
kind of posting about him,

00:03:46.030 --> 00:03:48.940
telling people to, you
know, adopt, not buy.

00:03:48.940 --> 00:03:51.220
And I fell in love with him.

00:03:51.220 --> 00:03:52.560
And he's just so adorable.

00:03:52.560 --> 00:03:55.780
Like you said, he does, like,
he's very good with tricks.

00:03:55.780 --> 00:03:57.630
If I say nose, he would go up and like,

00:03:57.630 --> 00:04:00.220
poke his nose through my fingers.

00:04:00.220 --> 00:04:01.590
And, uh-

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:04.810
His favorite food is, uh-

00:04:04.810 --> 00:04:07.800
His favorite food? Just
any type of dog snack.

00:04:07.800 --> 00:04:09.683
We give him, like, all these treats.

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:12.490
He just likes anything, to be honest.

00:04:12.490 --> 00:04:14.293
Anything that's related to eating.

00:04:15.357 --> 00:04:16.190
And, yeah.

00:04:16.190 --> 00:04:18.264
His favorite color? I have no idea.

00:04:18.264 --> 00:04:19.156
(Rosé laughs)

00:04:19.156 --> 00:04:20.860
I'll ask him that!

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:21.913
- You'll have to ask.

00:04:23.180 --> 00:04:24.610
Everybody, Rosé's-

00:04:24.610 --> 00:04:26.310
I love that we're ending there, Rosé.

00:04:26.310 --> 00:04:28.130
There's no segue.

00:04:28.130 --> 00:04:31.300
Rosé's debut solo project is called "R,"

00:04:31.300 --> 00:04:33.200
and her single is "On the Ground."

00:04:33.200 --> 00:04:34.220
And it's an amazing song.

00:04:34.220 --> 00:04:35.080
You got to check it out.

00:04:35.080 --> 00:04:36.680
Both are actually out right now.

